---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import SoundReadingPaths from '../../components/SoundReadingPaths.astro';
import ResearchContents from '../../components/ResearchContents.astro';
import story from '../../../../../kb/research/culture/odia-lullabies-website.json';
const sections=story.blocks.map((block,index)=>({...block,id:block.title?`story-section-${index+1}`:undefined}));
const contents=[...sections.filter(block=>block.title).map(block=>({title:block.title,href:'#'+block.id})),{title:'Sources & reading notes',href:'#story-sources'}];
---
<Shell title={story.title} description={story.lead} active="explore" wide related={false}>
<article class="wrap odia-lullabies-story"><a class="text-link collection-return" href="/sounds-of-odisha/">← Sounds of Odisha</a>
<header class="odia-lullabies-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">Sounds of Odisha · Further reading</p><h1>Odia lullabies.<br/><em>The songs of childhood.</em></h1><p class="lead">{story.lead}</p></div><aside class="listening-panel" aria-label="Listening guide"><p class="eyebrow">{story.listening_panel.heading}</p>{story.listening_panel.steps.map((step,i)=><div class="listening-step"><span aria-hidden="true">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><div><h2>{step.label}</h2><p>{step.prompt}</p></div></div>)}<p class="panel-note">{story.listening_panel.note}</p></aside></header>
<div class="odia-lullabies-reading"><ResearchContents items={contents} label="In this story"/>{sections.map(b=><section>{b.title&&<h2 id={b.id}>{b.title}</h2>}{b.items.length>0&&<p>{b.paragraphs[0]}</p>}{b.items.length>0&&<ol>{b.items.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ol>}{(b.items.length>0?b.paragraphs.slice(1):b.paragraphs).map(p=><p>{p}</p>)}</section>)}
<p class="notice">A sourced reader story. Odia literary and family-context review remains open. This page provides a reading story; no audio recording is included.</p>
<p><a href="/sounds-of-odisha/huluhuli/">Follow Huluhuli →</a> · <a href="/sounds-of-odisha/listening-notebook/">Take a listening notebook →</a></p>
<details id="story-sources" class="utk-disclosure odia-lullabies-credits"><summary>Sources &amp; reading notes</summary><p>{story.limits} Desk review: {story.reviewed_on}.</p><ul>{story.sources.map(s=><li><a href={s.resource}>{s.title}</a> — {s.locator}</li>)}</ul><p><a href="https://ova.gov.in/en/ReadEbooks?bid=BtWICDPU9ic%3D">Read the Academy’s digitised Nanabaya Gita</a></p><p>The Academy’s catalogue and digital text share one host. Its 1955 date identifies the catalogued edition, not the beginning of Odia lullabies. The earlier 1934 publication statement in Dash’s discussion remains an edition-research question. Similar song titles do not settle authorship. The published Panda interview is not an interview conducted by Project Odisha. No lyrics, literal verse translation or audio transcription are reproduced.</p></details>
<SoundReadingPaths current="odia-lullabies"/>
<p><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fstories%2Fodia-lullabies%2F">Suggest a correction or a public source</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p><a class="text-link" href="/sounds-of-odisha/">Return to Sounds of Odisha →</a></div>
</article></Shell>
<style>.listening-panel{background:var(--paper,#f4ede1);border:1px solid var(--line,#d8cfc2);padding:clamp(24px,3vw,40px)}.listening-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:34px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d8cfc2)}.listening-step>span{color:var(--clay,#844b35);font-size:14px}.listening-step h2{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px}.listening-step p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}.panel-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:20px 0 0}.odia-lullabies-story{padding-bottom:70px}.collection-return{display:inline-block;margin:28px 0}.odia-lullabies-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:clamp(28px,5vw,100px);align-items:center;margin:12px 0 52px}.odia-lullabies-hero h1{font-size:clamp(48px,5vw,84px);line-height:1.08}.odia-lullabies-hero h1 em{color:var(--sea)}.odia-lullabies-hero figure{margin:0}.odia-lullabies-hero img{width:100%;height:auto}.odia-lullabies-hero figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.odia-lullabies-reading{max-width:900px;margin:auto;font-size:19px;line-height:1.85}.odia-lullabies-reading section{margin-bottom:40px}.odia-lullabies-reading h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3vw,44px);line-height:1.2;margin:36px 0 18px}.odia-lullabies-reading li{margin:12px 0}.odia-lullabies-credits{font-size:16px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:30px 0}.odia-lullabies-credits li{margin:10px 0}@media(max-width:760px){.odia-lullabies-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px}.odia-lullabies-hero h1{font-size:46px}.odia-lullabies-reading{font-size:17px}.odia-lullabies-reading section{margin-bottom:28px}}</style>
